1
00:00:14,537 --> 00:00:16,017
Where?

2
00:00:16,017 --> 00:00:17,697
Where are you?

3
00:00:18,667 --> 00:00:23,987
Pretty, pretty niece. My pretty niece.

4
00:00:24,467 --> 00:00:27,507
My pretty fr채ulein.

5
00:00:27,987 --> 00:00:34,017
Budding flower and successor to the
 Royal Order of Protestant Knights Hellsing Organization,

6
00:00:34,017 --> 00:00:37,977
Integra Fairbrook Wingates Hellsing.

7
00:00:38,737 --> 00:00:41,977
Integra, you don't understand a thing.

8
00:00:42,817 --> 00:00:49,067
I waited 20 years for my brother, no, your father to die.

9
00:00:49,067 --> 00:00:53,557
But then at the hour of his death,
 he made you head of the family and died.

10
00:00:53,557 --> 00:00:56,657
Leaving a will which I can not accept.

11
00:00:56,657 --> 00:00:58,037
He shouldn't have done that.

12
00:00:58,847 --> 00:01:01,297
It was an unforgivable act.

13
00:01:01,297 --> 00:01:04,667
Hellsing is mine!

14
00:01:05,327 --> 00:01:07,067
Integra...

15
00:01:07,937 --> 00:01:12,197
If it should ever come to it... If the situation is critical...

16
00:01:13,057 --> 00:01:17,427
If you've been cornered by the enemy and there's nothing else you can do,

17
00:01:17,427 --> 00:01:20,727
go to the long-forgotten jail in the basement.

18
00:01:20,727 --> 00:01:26,237
One of the legacies of our Hellsing family is there.

19
00:01:26,237 --> 00:01:28,777
A means for your protection.

20
00:01:44,297 --> 00:01:48,107
This is the means for my protection?

21
00:01:52,137 --> 00:01:54,427
I've found you, fr채ulein.

22
00:02:06,227 --> 00:02:06,897
Uncle...

23
00:02:07,257 --> 00:02:10,407
That's right, fr채ulein.

24
00:02:10,737 --> 00:02:15,997
Y-You want the Hellsing family so badly that you'd be willing to go so far as to...

25
00:02:16,607 --> 00:02:19,497
Right once again, fr채ulein.

26
00:02:54,527 --> 00:02:55,877
The dead body!

27
00:02:55,877 --> 00:02:57,117
It's...!

28
00:04:27,487 --> 00:04:28,367
Bastards!

29
00:04:40,257 --> 00:04:41,457
What's that?

30
00:04:41,457 --> 00:04:43,887
What did you just say?

31
00:04:51,747 --> 00:04:55,237
Please, I'd appreciate it if you'd tell us one more time,

32
00:04:55,807 --> 00:04:57,267
Director of Hellsing,

33
00:04:57,267 --> 00:05:01,537
Sir Integra Fairbrook Wingates Hellsing.

34
00:05:01,537 --> 00:05:04,247
Very well, I'll tell you once more.

35
00:05:05,117 --> 00:05:06,337
They're ghouls.

36
00:05:06,337 --> 00:05:08,957
The village has become a den of ghouls.

37
00:05:10,587 --> 00:05:15,467
Ghouls are what becomes of non-virgin
 human beings who've been attacked by vampires.

38
00:05:16,077 --> 00:05:20,347
They're much like zombies controlled by vampires.

39
00:05:22,417 --> 00:05:26,227
Which means there's a vampire in the village.

40
00:05:26,647 --> 00:05:30,137
Ghouls, vampires?

41
00:05:30,137 --> 00:05:30,977
That's ridiculous!

42
00:05:31,317 --> 00:05:34,487
You expect me to believe an occult story like that?

43
00:05:35,397 --> 00:05:40,777
Petty officials like you don't know and don't need to know.

44
00:05:41,337 --> 00:05:45,287
But our Royal Order of Protestant Knights, better known as the Hellsing Organization,

45
00:05:45,547 --> 00:05:49,307
has been fighting these monsters for a very long time.

46
00:05:49,717 --> 00:05:50,787
In fact it's only natural you don't know...

47
00:05:51,367 --> 00:05:54,797
Since we are a special operations agency organized...

48
00:05:54,797 --> 00:05:59,027
for the purpose of eradicating the satanic monsters...

49
00:05:59,027 --> 00:06:00,947
that wish to harm our
 British Empire and Protestant Church.

50
00:06:05,927 --> 00:06:09,227
There's a vampire in the village that's controlling the ghouls.

51
00:06:09,827 --> 00:06:12,057
The adversary is a monster.

52
00:06:12,057 --> 00:06:18,377
Send in all the regular troops and police you want.
 You're just providing them with more food.

53
00:06:19,907 --> 00:06:21,507
Only when a Dracula sucks the blood of a female virgin,

54
00:06:22,057 --> 00:06:28,207
or a Draculina sucks the blood of a male virgin, do the vampires breed new vampires.

55
00:06:28,207 --> 00:06:30,617
In all other cases, the victims are nothing more than food.

56
00:06:31,377 --> 00:06:35,627
They turn into ghouls and become the vampire's servants.

57
00:06:38,397 --> 00:06:41,507
I've lost the signal from Search Party Squads 2 and 3.

58
00:06:41,847 --> 00:06:42,677
What?

59
00:06:44,397 --> 00:06:45,347
What's going on?

60
00:06:45,347 --> 00:06:46,047
Answer!

61
00:06:46,047 --> 00:06:47,517
Answer! Hey!

62
00:06:51,307 --> 00:06:54,317
In order to keep the ghouls from multiplying further,

63
00:06:54,317 --> 00:06:58,027
you need to terminate the lead vampire itself.

64
00:06:59,007 --> 00:07:01,897
That's where we come in.

65
00:07:01,897 --> 00:07:04,457
Hellsing will take care of the vampire.

66
00:07:04,457 --> 00:07:05,657
Y-You can't be serious.

67
00:07:06,197 --> 00:07:12,297
One of our top anti-vampire experts
 is already on his way to the town of Cheddar.

68
00:07:13,217 --> 00:07:15,457
The issue will be settled in a matter of hours.

69
00:07:16,907 --> 00:07:18,627
Who the hell is he?

70
00:07:21,697 --> 00:07:23,387
When it comes to monsters...

71
00:07:24,057 --> 00:07:26,887
especially vampires...

72
00:07:27,927 --> 00:07:30,257
he's the greatest expert there is.

73
00:07:32,987 --> 00:07:34,467
It's a great night.

74
00:07:35,367 --> 00:07:38,667
The kind of night that makes me want to drink blood.

75
00:07:39,667 --> 00:07:43,987
Ah, the quiet. It really is a great evening.

76
00:08:17,567 --> 00:08:19,017
There's no use running.

77
00:08:29,597 --> 00:08:31,367
There's no use firing your gun either.

78
00:08:37,247 --> 00:08:39,997
Eddie... Simon...

79
00:08:40,297 --> 00:08:41,627
That's right.

80
00:08:41,627 --> 00:08:44,007
Your partners are mine now.

81
00:08:44,667 --> 00:08:46,637
I'm going to make you one of mine as well.

82
00:08:52,607 --> 00:08:56,197
What I want is a loyal slave.

83
00:08:56,197 --> 00:08:59,187
I don't want to create some Draculina with a will of her own.

84
00:09:01,177 --> 00:09:05,277
Girls your age aren't usually virgins nowadays, but...

85
00:09:06,357 --> 00:09:10,577
I'm still going to rape you.
After that, I'll take my time as I suck your blood.

86
00:09:10,857 --> 00:09:13,287
I'll let you join the other ghouls.

87
00:09:14,017 --> 00:09:15,787
I'm going to make you my slave.

88
00:09:37,537 --> 00:09:38,687
Who the hell are you?

89
00:09:39,237 --> 00:09:40,307
I'm a professional killer.

90
00:09:41,137 --> 00:09:42,467
A professional killer?

91
00:09:42,467 --> 00:09:45,357
You're a professional killer? You can't be serious.

92
00:09:45,357 --> 00:09:47,177
Have you lost your mind?

93
00:09:50,027 --> 00:09:51,207
Kill him.

94
00:10:30,737 --> 00:10:32,987
Are you dead already, professional killer?

95
00:10:57,887 --> 00:10:59,977
He's a vampire?

96
00:11:00,367 --> 00:11:01,307
That's right.

97
00:11:02,307 --> 00:11:06,487
Humans don't make very reliable anti-vampire experts.

98
00:11:06,487 --> 00:11:10,297
They're injured quickly. They die quickly.

99
00:11:10,297 --> 00:11:11,697
Even their spirits are weak.

100
00:11:13,987 --> 00:11:19,697
The most efficient way to destroy
 a vampire is with another vampire.

101
00:11:21,467 --> 00:11:26,707
And the domesticated vampire at the Hellsing Organization...

102
00:11:28,087 --> 00:11:31,217
is first class, even among them.

103
00:12:23,657 --> 00:12:25,937
H-How can he kill them like that?

104
00:12:26,567 --> 00:12:27,707
Those bullets...

105
00:12:35,097 --> 00:12:38,827
They're exploding 13mm shells,

106
00:12:39,237 --> 00:12:41,947
made out of a melted-down
 silver cross from Lancaster Cathedral.

107
00:12:42,527 --> 00:12:46,067
They'll kill any freak they hit.

108
00:12:54,287 --> 00:12:55,577
Wh-Why?

109
00:12:55,577 --> 00:12:57,317
Why?

110
00:12:57,317 --> 00:12:59,507
Why would a fellow vampire side with the humans?

111
00:13:03,127 --> 00:13:05,427
Don't move, professional killer!

112
00:13:05,427 --> 00:13:07,927
She's the only survivor.

113
00:13:07,927 --> 00:13:09,357
Don't you want to let her live?

114
00:13:10,077 --> 00:13:12,357
Come on, it's no big deal.

115
00:13:12,357 --> 00:13:13,857
Help me escape.

116
00:13:14,457 --> 00:13:16,287
Or at least look the other way.

117
00:13:17,917 --> 00:13:20,617
Young lady, are you a virgin?

118
00:13:21,817 --> 00:13:22,997
What are you talking about?!

119
00:13:22,997 --> 00:13:24,617
I'm asking if you're a virgin.

120
00:13:26,637 --> 00:13:27,747
You swine!

121
00:13:28,937 --> 00:13:29,877
Answer!

122
00:13:30,147 --> 00:13:31,877
Yes! I am-

123
00:13:54,667 --> 00:13:55,357
You...

124
00:13:56,167 --> 00:13:58,107
miserable creature!

125
00:14:08,447 --> 00:14:09,867
What's your name?

126
00:14:10,537 --> 00:14:13,877
Your father called me...

127
00:14:25,967 --> 00:14:27,387
Alucard.

128
00:14:51,717 --> 00:14:56,157
In order to hit his heart, I had to hit your lung.

129
00:14:56,157 --> 00:14:58,397
Sorry, but it's a high caliber gun.

130
00:14:58,397 --> 00:14:59,917
You won't last very long.

131
00:15:00,667 --> 00:15:01,767
What do you want to do?

132
00:15:24,577 --> 00:15:25,777
Father...

133
00:15:27,047 --> 00:15:28,077
Mother...

134
00:15:59,037 --> 00:16:02,567
Tonight... really is...

135
00:16:03,837 --> 00:16:05,497
a great night.

136
00:16:11,737 --> 00:16:12,567
Huh.

137
00:16:13,617 --> 00:16:15,737
Where am I?

138
00:16:20,957 --> 00:16:22,147
Holy smokes, it's a Police Girl!

139
00:16:22,147 --> 00:16:23,227
A cop!

140
00:16:23,227 --> 00:16:24,277
The fuzz!

141
00:16:24,277 --> 00:16:24,927
The law!

142
00:16:27,757 --> 00:16:29,097
I'm going to be raped,

143
00:16:29,097 --> 00:16:31,227
or killed!

144
00:16:41,167 --> 00:16:44,647
What's it feel like to be dead, Police Girl?

145
00:16:47,277 --> 00:16:49,277
But it was your choice.

146
00:16:53,327 --> 00:16:55,707
The path of the Draculina.

147
00:16:58,657 --> 00:17:00,377
I can't move.

148
00:17:10,517 --> 00:17:12,667
Where am I?

149
00:17:27,257 --> 00:17:31,707
Police Girl, how's it feel now that you're a Draculina?

150
00:17:37,617 --> 00:17:38,817
Fangs?!

151
00:17:38,817 --> 00:17:40,707
You're too loud, Police Girl.

152
00:17:40,707 --> 00:17:43,327
I don't care if you're a Draculina now.

153
00:17:43,327 --> 00:17:45,167
You still must act like an English woman.

154
00:17:47,497 --> 00:17:50,547
Draculina?

155
00:17:50,547 --> 00:17:54,427
Um, excuse me, but where am I?

156
00:17:55,157 --> 00:17:59,187
The Royal Order of Protestant Knights.
Better known as the Hellsing Organization.

157
00:18:00,147 --> 00:18:04,977
We expel monsters. We are monsters.

158
00:18:05,927 --> 00:18:07,987
So then I'm...

159
00:18:07,987 --> 00:18:11,927
Of course you'll be working for us as a
 member of the Hellsing Organization.

160
00:18:11,927 --> 00:18:15,997
We've had a string of incidents 
involving some suspicious Midians.

161
00:18:16,597 --> 00:18:18,857
Destroy the vampires, Police Girl.

162
00:18:25,947 --> 00:18:28,577
They severed their victims' heads
 and wrote messages with their blood.

163
00:18:29,617 --> 00:18:34,127
This is a challenge to Christianity and Christians.

164
00:18:34,127 --> 00:18:41,357
They're thumbing their noses at
 our church, our country, and Hellsing.

165
00:18:43,337 --> 00:18:45,917
The target is moving north on Route 17.

166
00:18:45,917 --> 00:18:49,317
They're going around attacking
 families they've selected beforehand.

167
00:18:49,907 --> 00:18:52,067
These goddamn freaks must not be allowed to live!

168
00:19:09,667 --> 00:19:12,817
Soon we'll be able to live forever.

169
00:19:13,687 --> 00:19:15,297
We'll be invincible vampires.

170
00:19:54,587 --> 00:19:58,757
You can't even change into fog or a bat.

171
00:19:58,757 --> 00:20:02,407
You can't even heal your gunshot wounds.

172
00:20:02,407 --> 00:20:05,597
If you run out of bullets, you can't even fight.

173
00:20:06,767 --> 00:20:10,427
And you want to be a nosferatu?

174
00:20:10,427 --> 00:20:11,357
Shame on you!

175
00:21:05,197 --> 00:21:07,447
Don't let her get away, Police Girl.

176
00:21:13,647 --> 00:21:15,087
Yes!

177
00:21:19,937 --> 00:21:20,997
What's wrong?

178
00:21:20,997 --> 00:21:21,597
Make it quick.

179
00:21:23,197 --> 00:21:25,407
She's incredibly fast!

180
00:21:25,407 --> 00:21:27,097
She's already 500 or 600 meters away.

181
00:21:27,937 --> 00:21:31,347
Think of yourself as having
 another eye on your forehead and shoot.

182
00:21:32,267 --> 00:21:37,147
Shoot like a human and you'll only be able to hit like a human.

183
00:21:37,147 --> 00:21:37,607
But...

184
00:21:38,357 --> 00:21:40,567
You can't miss.

185
00:21:40,567 --> 00:21:44,117
The heart. A single shot right through the heart.

186
00:21:44,977 --> 00:21:47,637
But I don't have a scope and it's very dark.

187
00:21:52,537 --> 00:21:54,777
That would be a problem if you were human.

188
00:21:54,777 --> 00:21:58,297
But you're no longer human.

189
00:22:28,817 --> 00:22:33,047
It's such a big gun and yet I hardly felt any recoil at all.

190
00:22:33,347 --> 00:22:35,587
It's night and yet I could see better than during the day.

191
00:22:36,267 --> 00:22:38,587
Well done, Police Girl.

192
00:22:38,587 --> 00:22:43,097
And now, I'm having a conversation through some sort of telepathy.

193
00:22:43,857 --> 00:22:47,427
What on earth's happening to me?

194
00:22:54,737 --> 00:22:55,857
I'm...

195
00:23:05,907 --> 00:23:06,617
Not yet.

196
00:23:07,657 --> 00:23:10,077
You still have a ways to go.

197
00:23:10,077 --> 00:23:13,607
And a long ways to go at that.

198
00:23:25,867 --> 00:23:27,207
Too many.

199
00:23:27,877 --> 00:23:29,307
Far too many.

200
00:23:31,317 --> 00:23:34,447
Too many vampire-related incidents.

201
00:23:35,657 --> 00:23:38,067
What's more, it's only third and fourth-rate small-timers,

202
00:23:38,067 --> 00:23:41,387
who just keep killing people at random.

203
00:23:41,807 --> 00:23:45,447
Nothing but pointless, cheap, pathetic and foolish acts.

204
00:23:45,967 --> 00:23:51,717
It's as if someone were churning out vampires, like it was the easiest thing in the world.

205
00:23:57,797 --> 00:24:00,957
Hey, both of you, stop that!

206
00:24:00,957 --> 00:24:03,507
You must never resort to violence against your friend.

207
00:24:03,507 --> 00:24:05,807
You can't go to heaven if you do that.

208
00:24:05,807 --> 00:24:07,847
I'm sorry, Father.

209
00:24:10,467 --> 00:24:18,057
Listen. The only people it's alright to use
 violence against are monsters and heathens.

210
00:24:21,707 --> 00:24:25,357
All right, go back to your room.

211
00:24:25,357 --> 00:24:27,087
Yes, Father!

212
00:24:27,087 --> 00:24:27,597
Let's go!

213
00:24:27,597 --> 00:24:28,487
Yeah.

214
00:24:31,567 --> 00:24:32,977
What can I do for you?

215
00:24:32,977 --> 00:24:35,367
What seems to be the matter?

216
00:24:36,627 --> 00:24:40,667
I'm afraid there's been quite a
 number of strange happenings of late.

217
00:24:40,667 --> 00:24:41,877
Especially in England.

218
00:24:42,417 --> 00:24:46,357
Yes. It seems there's quite a coverup going on.

219
00:24:46,357 --> 00:24:47,387
It's a vampire.

220
00:24:47,737 --> 00:24:48,637
Oh?

221
00:24:49,547 --> 00:24:53,767
Vampires have been turning up
 repeatedly within their borders.

222
00:24:53,767 --> 00:24:56,137
The numbers are clearly outside the norm.

223
00:24:56,517 --> 00:24:58,977
Nothing wrong with that, is there?

224
00:24:58,977 --> 00:25:02,667
Lots of English Protestants have died, right?

225
00:25:03,607 --> 00:25:05,417
No, they haven't.

226
00:25:05,417 --> 00:25:07,407
I believe you're familiar with Hellsing.

227
00:25:08,117 --> 00:25:11,407
They've performed better than we anticipated.

228
00:25:11,407 --> 00:25:15,037
Actually, it appears damage has been kept to a minimum.

229
00:25:15,037 --> 00:25:20,877
Those amateurs!
 They're like a kindergarten compared to us.

230
00:25:20,877 --> 00:25:26,497
Catholics, the Vatican and us.

231
00:25:26,497 --> 00:25:31,677
We've been fighting against them far longer than Hellsing has.

232
00:25:32,237 --> 00:25:34,077
What do you want from me?

233
00:25:34,077 --> 00:25:39,647
If the trouble is in England, we can let them handle it, no?

234
00:25:39,647 --> 00:25:41,017
If it were just in England.

235
00:25:41,497 --> 00:25:42,897
Oh?

236
00:25:42,897 --> 00:25:44,287
So, what is it?

237
00:25:44,287 --> 00:25:47,377
This time it occurred in Ireland.

238
00:25:47,377 --> 00:25:50,577
Northern Ireland. A local town, Badrick.

239
00:25:50,577 --> 00:25:51,977
Oh...

240
00:25:51,977 --> 00:25:54,557
Hellsing is on the move.

241
00:25:54,557 --> 00:25:58,417
We can't just sit back and watch.

242
00:25:59,477 --> 00:26:04,567
Brazenly sending in someone, as if it were their own territory.

243
00:26:04,567 --> 00:26:08,017
They're as shameless and presumptuous as always.

244
00:26:08,017 --> 00:26:10,547
That place doesn't belong to the Protestants.

245
00:26:11,287 --> 00:26:14,237
It's Catholic land. It belongs to us.

246
00:26:14,237 --> 00:26:16,557
We hunt the vampires.

247
00:26:17,247 --> 00:26:21,757
We can't allow them to get a head start on us, Anderson.

248
00:26:21,757 --> 00:26:24,607
And if I should run into Hellsing?

249
00:26:24,607 --> 00:26:29,897
We are the only and absolute
 instruments of God on Earth.

250
00:26:29,897 --> 00:26:32,697
We can not back away from a challenge coming from heretics.

251
00:26:33,187 --> 00:26:37,517
If anyone does not love the Lord Jesus Christ,

252
00:26:37,517 --> 00:26:42,707
let him be accursed. O Lord, come. Amen!

253
00:27:04,827 --> 00:27:05,607
Police Girl.

254
00:27:08,737 --> 00:27:10,497
They're not human beings.

255
00:27:10,497 --> 00:27:12,157
They're puppets. They might as well be pumpkins.

256
00:27:13,187 --> 00:27:14,727
They're just puppets.

257
00:27:14,727 --> 00:27:17,487
Aim... Fire. One shot and it's over.

258
00:27:51,617 --> 00:27:56,777
Police Girl, when you aim, make sure to
 put a hole through the heart or the head.

259
00:27:57,457 --> 00:28:01,287
These people didn't become
 ghouls because they wanted to.

260
00:28:02,407 --> 00:28:06,627
There's no way to change people who've
 become like this back to the way they were before.

261
00:28:06,627 --> 00:28:11,127
We shoot them dead quickly, for their own good.

262
00:28:21,197 --> 00:28:24,017
Sir... Yes, sir, my Master.

263
00:28:25,667 --> 00:28:26,307
Oh?

264
00:29:10,007 --> 00:29:15,067
Looks like she's getting the hang of being a Midian.

265
00:29:47,117 --> 00:29:48,807
A holy bayonet.

266
00:29:53,617 --> 00:29:54,227
A spiritual barrier?!

267
00:30:34,417 --> 00:30:39,647
We are the agents of God. We are the
 instruments of His divine punishment on Earth.

268
00:30:39,647 --> 00:30:45,897
Our mission is to wipe out every last bit of flesh of those fools...

269
00:30:45,897 --> 00:30:49,537
who oppose him.

270
00:30:50,427 --> 00:30:52,537
Amen!

271
00:30:53,267 --> 00:30:56,377
Chief, a report from our intelligence officer at the Vatican.

272
00:30:56,837 --> 00:30:59,167
Rome... the Vatican...

273
00:30:59,167 --> 00:31:03,137
The Vatican's Special Operations 13th Division,
 the Iscariot Organization, is on the move!

274
00:31:03,627 --> 00:31:05,057
Iscariot.

275
00:31:06,057 --> 00:31:12,767
The Vatican's unofficial special operations unit.
 The single most powerful fighting force they have.

276
00:31:13,347 --> 00:31:16,427
Professionals at exorcizing demons, suppressing heathens,

277
00:31:16,427 --> 00:31:18,777
and exterminating heretics.

278
00:31:19,737 --> 00:31:24,547
The 13th Division, named after Judas.
 It isn't even supposed to exist.

279
00:31:24,547 --> 00:31:25,527
How many?

280
00:31:25,987 --> 00:31:27,807
They've only sent in one person.

281
00:31:28,677 --> 00:31:31,787
The Paladin, Father Alexander Anderson!

282
00:31:34,757 --> 00:31:38,297
Father Alexander Anderson?

283
00:31:39,477 --> 00:31:42,547
What's going to happen if
 he runs into Alucard and the girl?

284
00:31:45,037 --> 00:31:47,227
I'm going to Badrick too!

285
00:31:47,227 --> 00:31:49,807
Get my gun, my sword and two bodyguards ready!

286
00:31:50,667 --> 00:31:51,307
Yes!

287
00:31:51,867 --> 00:31:54,547
Walter, I'll leave negotiations with the Vatican to you.

288
00:31:54,547 --> 00:31:55,807
Certainly.

289
00:31:57,777 --> 00:32:01,777
Paladin Anderson, Professional
 Killer Anderson, Bayonet Anderson,

290
00:32:01,777 --> 00:32:05,577
Judge Anderson the Beheader, Angel Dust Anderson.

291
00:32:05,577 --> 00:32:08,887
His origins, race and age are all a mystery.

292
00:32:08,887 --> 00:32:13,287
There is only one thing known about
 him other than his many nicknames.

293
00:32:13,287 --> 00:32:16,457
The fact that he's a specialist in fighting monsters.

294
00:32:17,057 --> 00:32:21,677
Just as Alucard is our trump
 card in the fight against monsters...

295
00:32:21,677 --> 00:32:25,967
he's the Vatican 13th Division's 
ace-in-the-hole for dealing with them.

296
00:32:28,197 --> 00:32:32,477
The monster-killing Paladin, the annihilationist!

297
00:32:34,357 --> 00:32:38,827
Put Alucard and the girl in front of
 him and he's bound to do something.

298
00:32:41,077 --> 00:32:43,647
It's a lovely moon, you monsters.

299
00:32:53,417 --> 00:32:58,327
You make such lovely cries of agony, young lady.

300
00:32:58,757 --> 00:33:02,337
But you won't die from that.

301
00:33:02,827 --> 00:33:06,427
That's because not a single dagger pierced your heart.

302
00:33:06,947 --> 00:33:09,117
It's been a while since I've gone vampire hunting.

303
00:33:09,117 --> 00:33:11,687
I have to enjoy it.

304
00:33:12,617 --> 00:33:17,667
Vatican 13th Division.
Special Operations Organization, Iscariot.

305
00:33:18,927 --> 00:33:22,247
That's right, you Hellsing lapdogs.

306
00:33:23,397 --> 00:33:25,607
So you're the miserable Alucard?

307
00:33:25,607 --> 00:33:29,157
The one who sides with
 humans even though he's a vampire.

308
00:33:29,157 --> 00:33:32,657
Hunter of vampires... Hellsing's garbage man.

309
00:33:33,367 --> 00:33:35,467
What did you do with the vampire here?

310
00:33:35,997 --> 00:33:37,617
I've dealt with him.

311
00:33:37,617 --> 00:33:39,747
He was a piddling, two-bit small-timer.

312
00:33:39,747 --> 00:33:42,277
I didn't even have time for fun.

313
00:33:58,977 --> 00:34:01,957
You two are the only ones left.

314
00:34:01,957 --> 00:34:03,477
Is that so?

315
00:34:26,987 --> 00:34:30,797
You're a brave Father to pick a fight with a vampire.

316
00:34:30,797 --> 00:34:33,517
And to do it head on, even though it's night.

317
00:34:33,517 --> 00:34:35,557
You didn't even try to catch me by surprise.

318
00:34:36,237 --> 00:34:38,057
But you're a fool.

319
00:34:39,427 --> 00:34:40,557
Master.

320
00:34:41,337 --> 00:34:42,607
Don't talk.

321
00:34:42,607 --> 00:34:45,317
You've been stabbed with a holy bayonet.

322
00:34:45,757 --> 00:34:47,687
Recovering under your own power will...

323
00:34:53,337 --> 00:34:54,277
What?!

324
00:35:59,927 --> 00:36:01,637
Amen!

325
00:36:03,017 --> 00:36:04,397
Regenerator...

326
00:36:04,637 --> 00:36:05,877
That's right.

327
00:36:05,877 --> 00:36:10,397
Our race was engineered and
 manufactured in order to fight you creatures.

328
00:36:36,417 --> 00:36:37,467
Amen!

329
00:36:40,107 --> 00:36:42,377
Master!

330
00:36:58,257 --> 00:36:59,227
Hurry!

331
00:36:59,227 --> 00:37:00,677
Knowing Iscariot...

332
00:37:00,677 --> 00:37:04,097
No, knowing Alucard, it's probably already started.

333
00:37:14,247 --> 00:37:18,757
This thing is Hellsing's trump card?!

334
00:37:18,757 --> 00:37:21,307
The best vampire they've raised?!

335
00:37:22,007 --> 00:37:25,847
You must be kidding me! He's a complete joke!

336
00:37:25,847 --> 00:37:28,807
Those Protestants can't do anything right.

337
00:37:32,397 --> 00:37:36,717
Oh, she's still able to move even after all that damage.

338
00:37:36,717 --> 00:37:41,617
It seems I may have taken the Draculina a little too lightly.

339
00:38:08,067 --> 00:38:09,187
Master...

340
00:38:11,117 --> 00:38:12,527
You're terrible.

341
00:38:13,437 --> 00:38:16,907
Dragging me into this... Leaving me all alone...

342
00:38:16,907 --> 00:38:19,447
I can't believe this is happening.

343
00:38:23,187 --> 00:38:25,157
Where do you think you're going?

344
00:38:26,157 --> 00:38:28,157
There's no place to run.

345
00:38:28,877 --> 00:38:30,347
Dust to dust.

346
00:38:30,347 --> 00:38:32,177
Pulvis et pulvis.

347
00:38:32,177 --> 00:38:35,747
You are nothing more than dust. And to dust you will return!

348
00:38:36,237 --> 00:38:37,257
Amen.

349
00:38:38,927 --> 00:38:40,077
I have to go!

350
00:38:40,077 --> 00:38:41,757
I-I have to escape!

351
00:38:42,407 --> 00:38:46,627
I have to get out of here and tell Integra!

352
00:38:56,777 --> 00:38:59,107
What's th-this?

353
00:38:59,447 --> 00:39:02,107
That's a spiritual barrier, little girl.

354
00:39:02,367 --> 00:39:06,617
It's impossible for you Midians to penetrate it.

355
00:39:07,117 --> 00:39:10,637
Now be quiet and let me
 slaughter you, you goddamn monster.

356
00:39:16,937 --> 00:39:18,257
H-He's going to kill me.

357
00:39:18,747 --> 00:39:19,757
He's going to kill me.

358
00:39:19,757 --> 00:39:21,257
He's going to kill me!

359
00:39:21,257 --> 00:39:22,377
I'm going to die!

360
00:39:24,757 --> 00:39:27,697
This is no time to lose your head, Police Girl.

361
00:39:29,327 --> 00:39:30,427
Master?

362
00:39:40,447 --> 00:39:43,027
Drink my blood, Police Girl,

363
00:39:44,507 --> 00:39:48,947
and you will not be a vampire
 who's treated only like a slave.

364
00:39:49,567 --> 00:39:53,537
You will truly be one of our kind.

365
00:39:53,537 --> 00:39:56,347
You will suck blood wisely,

366
00:39:56,347 --> 00:39:58,717
and stroll the night on your feet.

367
00:39:58,717 --> 00:40:01,087
Be the eternal "No-Life King."

368
00:40:01,087 --> 00:40:03,467
Drink my blood, Police Girl.

369
00:40:03,467 --> 00:40:06,337
No, Seras Victoria.

370
00:40:12,627 --> 00:40:14,167
It's over.

371
00:40:20,187 --> 00:40:22,387
That girl belongs to us.

372
00:40:22,387 --> 00:40:28,327
What do you think you're doing,
 Iscariot Paladin, Father Alexander Anderson?

373
00:40:29,877 --> 00:40:31,277
Director Integra.

374
00:40:31,277 --> 00:40:35,707
Sir Integra Fairbrook Wingates Hellsing.

375
00:40:35,707 --> 00:40:40,337
To what do I owe the honor of having
 the Director herself make an appearance?

376
00:40:40,657 --> 00:40:45,687
Father Anderson, this is a
 serious violation of our agreement.

377
00:40:45,687 --> 00:40:48,597
This place is supposed to be under our control.

378
00:40:48,597 --> 00:40:49,847
Withdraw immediately!

379
00:40:50,707 --> 00:40:55,057
If you don't, you'll cause a crisis between us and the Vatican.

380
00:40:55,057 --> 00:40:58,857
I don't care if you're the goddamn 13th Division.
 We won't allow such indiscretions.

381
00:40:58,857 --> 00:41:00,447
Withdraw?

382
00:41:00,447 --> 00:41:01,857
Did you say withdraw?!

383
00:41:03,127 --> 00:41:09,847
We? The 13th Division Iscariot,
 the agents of divine punishment on Earth?

384
00:41:09,847 --> 00:41:12,577
Don't take us lightly, you whore!

385
00:41:12,577 --> 00:41:17,497
We'd never retreat from you filthy Protestants!

386
00:41:24,627 --> 00:41:28,587
You're the ultimate in bio-engineered regeneration,

387
00:41:29,217 --> 00:41:31,247
as well as healing?

388
00:41:31,247 --> 00:41:32,397
You monster!

389
00:41:34,207 --> 00:41:37,497
You're all too weak, every single one of you.

390
00:41:37,497 --> 00:41:38,597
There's nothing to discuss.

391
00:41:39,357 --> 00:41:43,437
I chopped the head off that
 garbage man you're so proud of.

392
00:41:44,417 --> 00:41:45,937
I decapitated him.

393
00:41:46,557 --> 00:41:48,747
You chopped his head off?

394
00:41:48,747 --> 00:41:49,817
That's all?

395
00:41:49,817 --> 00:41:50,657
What?!

396
00:41:53,347 --> 00:41:55,617
Take your hands off Integra, you monster!

397
00:42:01,047 --> 00:42:05,257
You don't have a chance, Father Anderson.

398
00:42:05,257 --> 00:42:07,897
I'd back off quietly, if I were you.

399
00:42:08,477 --> 00:42:10,497
What are you talking about?

400
00:42:10,497 --> 00:42:12,887
I'm just about to finish you all off.

401
00:42:12,887 --> 00:42:14,727
Then you'd better make it quick.

402
00:42:15,547 --> 00:42:16,667
Because if you don't get a move on,

403
00:42:16,667 --> 00:42:19,637
that person you decapitated is going to come back to life!

404
00:42:19,637 --> 00:42:20,647
What?

405
00:42:33,857 --> 00:42:36,787
You didn't drink it, did you, you fool?

406
00:42:42,877 --> 00:42:44,867
You cut off his head?

407
00:42:44,867 --> 00:42:47,187
Pierced his heart?

408
00:42:47,187 --> 00:42:50,437
Don't put him in the same class as those other vampires.

409
00:42:51,277 --> 00:42:52,887
Those things won't kill him.

410
00:42:53,487 --> 00:42:56,637
Just as you are the culmination of anti-vampire technology,

411
00:42:56,957 --> 00:42:58,557
he is the greatest of the undead,

412
00:42:58,557 --> 00:43:03,227
which took the Hellsing family 100 years to create so proudly.

413
00:43:05,047 --> 00:43:08,117
The vampire, Alucard!

414
00:43:17,957 --> 00:43:18,867
Master!

415
00:43:37,207 --> 00:43:38,667
Now you understand.

416
00:43:39,637 --> 00:43:42,017
Well, what are you going to do, Anderson?

417
00:43:45,517 --> 00:43:47,287
I see.

418
00:43:47,287 --> 00:43:50,027
I'm not prepared to kill him as I am now.

419
00:43:52,357 --> 00:43:54,237
We'll meet again, Hellsing.

420
00:43:57,257 --> 00:43:59,897
Next time, I'll kill you all.

421
00:44:13,257 --> 00:44:14,737
That was close.

422
00:44:22,197 --> 00:44:24,727
Are you all right, Alucard?

423
00:44:24,727 --> 00:44:28,507
Yeah, it's been a while since I had my head plucked off.

424
00:44:29,557 --> 00:44:32,317
So that was Father Anderson from Iscariot?

425
00:44:33,317 --> 00:44:36,247
He attacked a member of the organization,

426
00:44:36,247 --> 00:44:39,767
and committed acts of bloodshed.

427
00:44:39,767 --> 00:44:42,407
The Vatican owes us big for this.

428
00:44:43,937 --> 00:44:47,167
However, they're not the one's we're fighting now.

429
00:44:48,117 --> 00:44:50,867
There's a large-scale organization working in the shadows,

430
00:44:50,867 --> 00:44:53,417
that's secretly behind this string of vampire attacks.

431
00:44:54,557 --> 00:44:56,557
Then give me the order.

432
00:44:56,557 --> 00:44:58,047
Tell me to wipe them out.

433
00:44:58,047 --> 00:45:00,317
Tell me to annihilate them.

434
00:45:00,317 --> 00:45:02,137
Tell me to turn them into dirt.

435
00:45:02,587 --> 00:45:03,807
That's what you should do,

436
00:45:04,467 --> 00:45:08,807
my Master, Integra Fairbrook Wingates Hellsing.

437
00:45:10,077 --> 00:45:12,067
When the time comes, I will.

438
00:45:12,937 --> 00:45:14,837
Really?

439
00:45:14,837 --> 00:45:16,567
It will be my pleasure.

440
00:45:16,567 --> 00:45:19,137
My great pleasure.

441
00:45:19,137 --> 00:45:20,827
My great, great, pleasure.

442
00:45:22,927 --> 00:45:23,757
Hey.

443
00:45:25,417 --> 00:45:27,207
Why didn't you drink my blood?

444
00:45:30,517 --> 00:45:31,957
Why didn't you drink it?

445
00:45:33,227 --> 00:45:35,157
I-I'm not sure.

446
00:45:36,387 --> 00:45:43,207
But I felt like if I drank your blood,
 it would mean the end of something.

447
00:45:43,967 --> 00:45:45,607
You nitwit.

448
00:45:46,987 --> 00:45:49,357
But perhaps that's all right.

449
00:45:50,117 --> 00:45:54,977
Maybe it's okay to have someone like you.
 Someone who's scared to walk at night.

450
00:46:00,587 --> 00:46:02,737
Why did you make the Police Girl one of your own kind?

451
00:46:03,637 --> 00:46:05,417
Why indeed...

452
00:46:05,417 --> 00:46:07,077
As a bit of entertainment?

453
00:46:07,077 --> 00:46:08,997
A spot of fun?

454
00:46:08,997 --> 00:46:11,517
A passing fancy?

455
00:46:11,517 --> 00:46:14,327
No, it's none of those things.

456
00:46:15,247 --> 00:46:19,737
Perhaps your human capriciousness has rubbed off on me,

457
00:46:19,737 --> 00:46:21,757
after spending so much time with you people.

458
00:46:22,787 --> 00:46:23,907
Come on, Police Girl.

459
00:46:23,907 --> 00:46:25,007
Don't dawdle.

460
00:46:25,007 --> 00:46:27,427
Y-Yes, sir. My Master.

461
00:46:28,697 --> 00:46:31,267
But, my name's not Police Girl.

462
00:46:31,737 --> 00:46:33,757
It's Seras Victoria.

463
00:46:35,137 --> 00:46:38,217
Shut up, you coward.

464
00:46:38,217 --> 00:46:40,167
You're Police Girl.

465
00:46:40,167 --> 00:46:41,777
"Police Girl" will do just fine.

466
00:46:42,117 --> 00:46:44,787
Y-You're so mean!

467
00:46:46,907 --> 00:46:48,777
M-Master!

468
00:46:52,897 --> 00:46:57,507
Or perhaps you could call it a
 "No-Life King's" sentimentality.

469
00:46:58,307 --> 00:47:02,007
No, "a Count's."

470
00:47:09,877 --> 00:47:11,027
Ladies and Gentlemen...

471
00:47:12,627 --> 00:47:18,477
let's carry on with the plans for the war!

472
00:47:18,477 --> 00:47:21,527
For the next war!

473
00:47:21,527 --> 00:47:25,367
For the war after the next war!

474
00:47:25,367 --> 00:47:27,367


